    dcterms:description "Adient site 50 (RO, tier-2 internal, metal structures making): inbound logistic routes from sites 11, 16, 33, 34, 37, 730, 972 with freight mode, lead time, distance, truck capacities, receiving and empty-return frequencies and full-truck cost."@en ;
